                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e4651cae-301d-3c9c-bf9d-d613b2bd9218",
                        "entry_id": "06608e55-cfce-3884-93f1-5a323aedee9a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "liefhebber van zoetigheden"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "435df2e0-aa64-4c0c-882d-b4baf0144338",
                                "sense_id": "e4651cae-301d-3c9c-bf9d-d613b2bd9218",
                                "text": "Slakken. Strooi tegen het vallen van de avond paneermeel op een tegelpad vlak bij begroeiing. Wacht een paar uur, vang de snoepers en laat ze ergens vrij waar ze geen kwaad kunnen. Of vul een jampotje zonder deksel met bier en graaf het in de grond, laat het glas ongeveer een centimeter boven de grond uitsteken. De slakken verdrinken erin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7f3402c-cbc6-4206-93b5-7d597111d8f9",
                                "sense_id": "e4651cae-301d-3c9c-bf9d-d613b2bd9218",
                                "text": "Indra kijkt op de klok. Het laatste uur is bijna voorbij. Heike kan over een kwartiertje bij haar zijn. Ze heeft zin om haar vriendin te verrassen. Maar waarmee? Heike is geen snoeper. Ineens weet ze iets. Gisteravond heeft ze hun lievelingsnummer gedownload."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6b60111-a505-4372-876c-915b7da7c69f",
                                "sense_id": "e4651cae-301d-3c9c-bf9d-d613b2bd9218",
                                "text": "‘En dat is goed nieuws voor snoepers die moeilijk maat kunnen houden.’ ‘Zo’n hersluitbare verpakking openen, is een psychologische drempel die ons telkens weer doet nadenken, al is het maar voor even’, zegt Van Kerckhove."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e8f13805-8c06-31c4-8d43-42e99cb178a4",
                        "entry_id": "06608e55-cfce-3884-93f1-5a323aedee9a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "liefhebber van vrouwen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "31637b28-b636-4c4b-9485-8b0ec8dc4916",
                        "source_entry_id": "06608e55-cfce-3884-93f1-5a323aedee9a",
                        "source_sense_id": "e4651cae-301d-3c9c-bf9d-d613b2bd9218",
                        "source_sense_description": "liefhebber van zoetigheden",
                        "target_lang_word": "gourmand",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gourmand",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40cceae9-5c26-37a5-b9dc-3f5be9d4e44c",
                                        "entry_id": "665b4e52-a5fb-3ffe-be0d-2918482d4cad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person given to excess in the consumption of food and drink; a greedy or ravenous eater."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98b9015f-6642-4eb5-8c60-f0fc00b1c40f",
                                                "sense_id": "40cceae9-5c26-37a5-b9dc-3f5be9d4e44c",
                                                "text": "I knew him, at Caivs trencher, when for hyre, / He proſtituted his abuſed body / To that great gourmond, fat Apicivs;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6850d1a-2d3c-495b-86b6-f4ecab747eeb",
                                                "sense_id": "40cceae9-5c26-37a5-b9dc-3f5be9d4e44c",
                                                "text": "The colonel and his sponsor made a queer contrast: Greystone [the sponsor] long and stringy, with a face that seemed as if a cold wind was eternally playing on it. […] But there was not a more lascivious reprobate and gourmand in all London than this same Greystone."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a05caa91-a6b2-3eeb-82bd-48dc1500f960",
                                        "entry_id": "665b4e52-a5fb-3ffe-be0d-2918482d4cad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who appreciates good food."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa55b460-2e6c-4e05-b08a-5d5c72af98e7",
                                                "sense_id": "a05caa91-a6b2-3eeb-82bd-48dc1500f960",
                                                "text": "The third key was the number of demands from different patrons or groups for their own specialized cuisines. Such patrons included the court, rich households, and scholar-gourmands. Buddhists and Muslims also elaborated their own cuisines (sucai 素菜 and qingzhen 清真)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5ddb9141-bbaf-4d8a-b1f6-b695bbdc7989",
                        "source_entry_id": "06608e55-cfce-3884-93f1-5a323aedee9a",
                        "source_sense_id": "e4651cae-301d-3c9c-bf9d-d613b2bd9218",
                        "source_sense_description": "liefhebber van zoetigheden",
                        "target_lang_word": "gastronome",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gastronome",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d7a8cb1-e1db-3275-ab01-cf7e2337b5a1",
                                        "entry_id": "e95c4530-f45d-3f3d-84d6-48a738b3dbeb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "a lover of good food; a connoisseur or gourmet"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf320626-645a-43c5-b805-21cef40809bf",
                                                "sense_id": "1d7a8cb1-e1db-3275-ab01-cf7e2337b5a1",
                                                "text": "A gastronome ought to fast sometimes on principle: we appreciate no pleasures unless we are occasionally debarred from them. Restraint is the golden rule of enjoyment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
